* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RMPRBUB - Print Active Bundle Binary
* Bundle Contents is printed as follows:
* - ALL
*   The bundle is completely printed on the destination printer. After
*   each printed report a close printer is processed (to get different
*   files on disk or in the destination spooling system)
* - PORTION
*   The Program is advised to print only a portion of the Bundle.
* Bundle Separators and Bundle VTOC are generally ignored.
*
* Maintenance
* uuuuuuuu yyyy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
* fhi      2009-06-07 N3463     created from RMPRBU, binary bundles
* fhi      2009-07-15 N3463     check for last report in bundle
* fhi      2009-10-30 P321483   Introduce CONFIRM in jobcards
* fhi      2010-02-22 P321483   Data field handling incorrect
* fhi      2010-04-06 P321962   Set correct status at end
* fhi      2010-04-12 P307403   Honour error-fields of NOMEX014
* fhi      2010-08-09 NOMALL-93 Write statistics for Optimize
* fhi      2010-08-31 NOMALL-93 Introduce trace levels                  STEM
* fhi      2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Extend message line
* fhi      2010-09-09 NOMALL-93 Extend supplied values                  STEM
* fhi      2010-11-25 NOMALL-856 Use symbol replacement
* xsetggr  2010-12-21 NOMALL-865 restow due to changes RMFL---P
* fhi      2011-02-01 NOMALL-922 Reuse printer tasks
* fhi     2011-03-21 NOMALL-947 log complete error text
* raya    2012-02-01 NOMALL-1096 error-text a250 in NOMWK--P stow only
* xsetggr 2012-02-02 NOMALL-1100 add lg-object-name when write to log
* raya    2012-02-08 NOMALL-98   check exit member to avoide err 82
* raya    2012-04-18 NOMALL-98   change in rmove-steplib
* fhi     2012-06-18 NOMALL-1152 Scrambled files with DISKUNIX bundles
* raya    2012-08-15 NOMALL-78   disable long records
* fhi     2012-11-09 NOMALL-1143 Add cpu time output
* raya    2012-11-29 NOMALL-1214 check cat date of nomex*
* raya    2013-01-08 NOMALL-1214 check cat date of user exit
* raya    2013-05-09 NOMALL-1214 backout check cat date of nomex*
* fhi     2014-02-13 NOMALL-1352 Re-create NOMEX015 from NOM322
* SU1     2014-06-11 ....... remove unused data areas
* SU2     2014-11-17 NOMALL-1450 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* fhi     2015-06-30 NOMALL-1655 Leave copies field as entered
* SU3     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1802 do not update Adabas Vista fields
* SU4     2016-08-10 NOM 3.5: remove unused code
* fhi     2016-11-15 NOMALL-1961 Use new task IDs
* fhi     2017-03-31 NOMALL-2009 Improve RDC handling
* SU5     2017-12-27 NOMALL-1823 NOM 3.5: remove CONNECT
* fhi     2018-03-16 NOMALL-1918 Get it on Unix / Correct NPR Logons
* fhi     2018-12-14 NOM 3.5     Improve CPU measures, no tags
* SU6     2019-07-17 NOMALL-2297 deactive NOMEX015(performance
* SU7     2019-11-13 NOMALL-2348 do not cut msg
* SU8     2020-05-18 NOMALL-2349 use N-CHKCAT + N-ESYLG
* SU9     2021-04-16 NOMALL-2454 recat RMTASK-P to avoid NAT1305
* SU10    2023-01-13 NOMALL-2607 return error (print bundle)
* SU11    2024-03-07 ES-34613    NOM 3.6 Remove power
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA GLOBAL USING PRINT-GL
INDEPENDENT
